**Lesson 7: Mastering Async Programming and Task-Based Asynchrony**

**OBJECTIVES:**

1. Implement async/await keywords to simplify asynchronous programming in C#.
2. Use the Task and Task<T> types to represent ongoing operations and manage continuations.
